<title>USA: Levittown UFSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Levittown UFSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $17.390 million of Levittown UFSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.3357 percent.</p>
